## Central Goa is the most expensive city to eat in; Sirsa is the cheapest

Median cost for two is ₹400 in Central Goa, against ₹150 in Sirsa. Across all listings the median is ₹250. I used medians because a few bad entries (the largest price is ₹199,246) distort averages.

